---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Support | Tidewater" description="Get help with a Tidewater bid purchase, billing, receipts or refunds.">
<section class="section"><div class="container article legal"><h1>Support</h1>
<p class="lead">Email <a href="mailto:hello@tidewaterbid.com">hello@tidewaterbid.com</a>. A person reads every message, and we aim to reply within one business day.</p>
<p>Include the listing name or your receipt number so we can find your order quickly.</p>

<h2>After you buy a bid</h2>
<ol>
<li>You get a receipt by email from Stripe right away.</li>
<li>We confirm your eligibility and tell you what we need from you, with dates.</li>
<li>We prepare the proposal and send it to you for approval.</li>
<li>We submit it once you approve, and send you the submission confirmation.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Billing and receipts</h2>
<p>Stripe emails a receipt for every payment. Need an invoice, a copy of a receipt, or a change to your billing details? Email us. Retainer clients can also update their payment method and see invoices through the billing link in their welcome email.</p>

<h2>Refunds and cancellations</h2>
<p>Refunds follow our <a href="/terms#refunds">refund terms</a>. To ask for one, or to cancel a retainer, email us; retainer cancellations follow your written agreement.</p>

<h2>A charge you don't recognize</h2>
<p>Tidewater charges appear on statements as <strong>TIDEWATER BID</strong>. If something looks wrong, email us before contacting your bank and we will sort it out directly.</p>

<h2>Mail</h2>
<p>Tidewater, 1708 A St SE, Washington, DC 20003.</p>
</div></section>
</Base>
